logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Test / coverage
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Databases (PoC SQLite)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

